  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="90de55a4-7005-56c3-b5e7-d7e214ef1691" activityNameId="08b6cefe-433b-5b6a-a1ce-fbe154fe0a6c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Potato seed organic, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Potato seed organic, at farm
Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg potato seed organic, at farm with a moisture content of 80%. Fresh matter yield/ha at 80% moisture is 19500kg.;
Synonyms: Solanum tuberosum L.; 
UUID: 915fde28-8b75-3e84-a83e-84485f7cd727
The inventory includes the processes of soil cultivation, sowing, weed control, fertilisation, pest and pathogen control and harvest. Machine infrastructure and a shed for machine sheltering is included. Inputs of fertilisers, pesticides and seed as well as their transports to the farm (1km) are considered. The direct emissions on the field are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Organic production
Time period: The yield data have been collected for the years 1996-2003.
Production volume: CH prod of seed potatoes: 27500t in 2004.
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, pilot network, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services, information provided by retailers and expert knowledge. The production data were verified and adjusted by a group of experts. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_915fde28-8b75-3e84-a83e-84485f7cd727.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
